{"id":"s1-1-5","courseId":"s1","chapterNumber":"1.5","title":"Faktorisering og forenkling","description":"Systematisk faktorisering av rasjonale uttrykk og forenkling av brøkuttrykk.","estimatedMinutes":50,"competenceGoals":["faktorisere og forenkle algebraiske uttrykk"],"content":[{"id":"s1-1-5-intro","type":"text","content":"## Rasjonale uttrykk\n\nEt **rasjonalt uttrykk** er en brøk der teller og nevner er polynomer. For å forenkle:\n1. Faktoriser teller og nevner fullstendig\n2. Forkort felles faktorer\n3. Angi begrensninger på variabelen"},{"id":"s1-1-5-metoder","type":"note","title":"Faktoriseringsmetoder","content":"**Felles faktor:** $6x^2 + 9x = 3x(2x + 3)$\n**Andregradsuttrykk:** $x^2 + 5x + 6 = (x+2)(x+3)$\n**Konjugatsetningen:** $x^2 - 9 = (x-3)(x+3)$\n**Kvadratsetningene:** $x^2 + 6x + 9 = (x+3)^2$\n**Gruppering:** $x^3 + x^2 - x - 1 = x^2(x+1) - (x+1) = (x+1)(x^2-1)$"},{"id":"s1-1-5-example-1","type":"example","title":"Eksempel 1: Forenkle rasjonalt uttrykk","problem":"Forenkle $\\dfrac{x^2 - 4}{x^2 + 4x + 4}$.","solution":"Teller: $(x-2)(x+2)$. Nevner: $(x+2)^2$. $$\\frac{(x-2)(x+2)}{(x+2)^2} = \\frac{x-2}{x+2}, \\quad x \\neq -2$$"},{"id":"s1-1-5-example-2","type":"example","title":"Eksempel 2: Addere rasjonale uttrykk","problem":"Forenkle $\\dfrac{1}{x-1} + \\dfrac{2}{x+1}$.","solution":"Fellesnevner $(x-1)(x+1)$: $$\\frac{(x+1) + 2(x-1)}{(x-1)(x+1)} = \\frac{3x-1}{x^2-1}$$"},{"id":"s1-1-5-warning","type":"warning","title":"Vanlig feil","content":"Man kan **bare** forkorte faktorer, ikke ledd! $\\frac{x+3}{x+5} \\neq \\frac{3}{5}$ (FEIL). Men $\\frac{x(x+3)}{x(x+5)} = \\frac{x+3}{x+5}$ er riktig."},{"id":"s1-1-5-ex-block-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-1-5-ex-1","number":"1.5.1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Faktoriser uttrykkene fullstendig.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$x^2 - 6x + 9$","solution":"$(x-3)^2$","expressionAnswer":"(x-3)^2"},{"label":"b","task":"$2x^2 - 8$","solution":"$2(x-2)(x+2)$","expressionAnswer":"2*(x-2)*(x+2)"},{"label":"c","task":"$x^3 - x$","solution":"$x(x-1)(x+1)$","expressionAnswer":["x*(x-1)*(x+1)","x*(x-1)*(x+1)"]}],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-1-5-ex-block-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-1-5-ex-2","number":"1.5.2","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Forenkle de rasjonale uttrykkene.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\dfrac{x^2 - 9}{x^2 - 6x + 9}$","solution":"$\\frac{(x-3)(x+3)}{(x-3)^2} = \\frac{x+3}{x-3}$, $x \\neq 3$.","expressionAnswer":"(x+3)/(x-3)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\dfrac{x^2 + 3x}{x^2 + 5x + 6}$","solution":"$\\frac{x(x+3)}{(x+2)(x+3)} = \\frac{x}{x+2}$, $x \\neq -3$.","expressionAnswer":"x/(x+2)"}],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-1-5-ex-block-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-1-5-ex-3","number":"1.5.3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Utfør regneoperasjonene og forenkle.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\dfrac{2}{x+1} - \\dfrac{1}{x-1}$","solution":"$\\frac{2(x-1)-(x+1)}{(x+1)(x-1)} = \\frac{x-3}{x^2-1}$","expressionAnswer":"(x-3)/(x^2-1)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\dfrac{x}{x-2} \\cdot \\dfrac{x^2-4}{x^2}$","solution":"$\\frac{x(x-2)(x+2)}{(x-2)x^2} = \\frac{x+2}{x}$, $x \\neq 2$.","expressionAnswer":"(x+2)/x"}],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-1-5-ex-block-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-1-5-ex-4","number":"1.5.4","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Forenkle de sammensatte brøkuttrykkene.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\dfrac{\\frac{1}{x} - \\frac{1}{y}}{\\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{y}}$","solution":"Teller: $\\frac{y-x}{xy}$. Nevner: $\\frac{y+x}{xy}$. Svar: $\\frac{y-x}{y+x}$.","expressionAnswer":"(y-x)/(y+x)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\dfrac{1 - \\frac{4}{x^2}}{1 - \\frac{4}{x} + \\frac{4}{x^2}}$","solution":"Gang med $x^2$: $\\frac{x^2-4}{x^2-4x+4} = \\frac{(x-2)(x+2)}{(x-2)^2} = \\frac{x+2}{x-2}$.","expressionAnswer":"(x+2)/(x-2)"}],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-1-5-ex-block-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-1-5-ex-5","number":"1.5.5","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Vis at $\\dfrac{x^3 - 8}{x^2 - 4} = \\dfrac{x^2 + 2x + 4}{x + 2}$ for $x \\neq 2$.","hints":["Bruk $a^3 - b^3 = (a-b)(a^2+ab+b^2)$."],"solution":"$x^3-8=(x-2)(x^2+2x+4)$, $x^2-4=(x-2)(x+2)$. Forkort $(x-2)$: $\\frac{x^2+2x+4}{x+2}$. $\\square$","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-1-5-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Faktoriseringsmetoder**: Sett felles faktor utenfor, bruk kvadratsetningene og konjugatsetningen, eller finn nullpunkter med abc-formelen.\n- **Forenkling av rasjonale uttrykk**: Faktoriser teller og nevner fullstendig før du forkorter — du kan bare stryke felles *faktorer*, aldri ledd.\n- **Addisjon av brøker**: Faktoriser nevnerne for å finne minste fellesnevner.\n\n### Nøkkelbegreper\n| Begrep | Forklaring |\n|--------|------------|\n| Felles faktor | Faktor som finnes i alle ledd |\n| Kvadratsetningene | $(a \\pm b)^2 = a^2 \\pm 2ab + b^2$ |\n| Konjugatsetningen | $(a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2$ |\n| Minste fellesnevner | Det minste uttrykket alle nevnerne deler |\n\n### Viktige formler\n- $a^2 + 2ab + b^2 = (a + b)^2$\n- $a^2 - 2ab + b^2 = (a - b)^2$\n- $a^2 - b^2 = (a + b)(a - b)$\n- $ax^2 + bx + c = a(x - x_1)(x - x_2)$ der $x_1, x_2$ er nullpunktene"},{"id":"s1-1-5-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgaver","buttonText":"Vis repetisjonsoppgaver","content":[{"id":"s1-1-5-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-1-5-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Forkort uttrykkene.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\dfrac{x^2 - 16}{x - 4}$","solution":"$\\frac{(x-4)(x+4)}{x-4} = x + 4$","expressionAnswer":"x+4"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\dfrac{6x^2 + 9x}{3x}$","solution":"$\\frac{3x(2x + 3)}{3x} = 2x + 3$","expressionAnswer":"2x+3"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\dfrac{x^2 + 6x + 9}{x + 3}$","solution":"$\\frac{(x+3)^2}{x+3} = x + 3$","expressionAnswer":"x+3"}],"solution":"a) $x+4$  b) $2x+3$  c) $x+3$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Bruk konjugatsetningen i a.","Sett $3x$ utenfor parentes i telleren i b."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-1-5-rep-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-1-5-rep-ex-2","number":"R2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Regn ut med kvadratsetningene.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$(x + 5)^2$","solution":"$x^2 + 2 \\cdot 5x + 25 = x^2 + 10x + 25$","expressionAnswer":"x^2+10x+25"},{"label":"b","task":"$(x - 3)^2$","solution":"$x^2 - 6x + 9$","expressionAnswer":"x^2-6x+9"},{"label":"c","task":"$(x + 2)(x - 2)$","solution":"Konjugatsetningen: $x^2 - 4$","expressionAnswer":"x^2-4"}],"solution":"a) $x^2+10x+25$  b) $x^2-6x+9$  c) $x^2-4$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Første kvadratsetning: $(a+b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2$.","Konjugatsetningen: $(a+b)(a-b) = a^2 - b^2$."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-1-5-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-1-5-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Faktoriser og forkort.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\dfrac{x^2 - x - 6}{x^2 - 9}$","solution":"Teller: $x^2 - x - 6 = (x-3)(x+2)$ (nullpunkter $3$ og $-2$). Nevner: $(x-3)(x+3)$. Forkortet: $\\frac{x+2}{x+3}$.","expressionAnswer":"(x+2)/(x+3)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\dfrac{2x^2 - 8}{x^2 + 2x}$","solution":"$\\frac{2(x-2)(x+2)}{x(x+2)} = \\frac{2(x-2)}{x} = \\frac{2x - 4}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"(2x-4)/x"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\dfrac{x^2 - 2x + 1}{x^2 - 1}$","solution":"$\\frac{(x-1)^2}{(x-1)(x+1)} = \\frac{x-1}{x+1}$","expressionAnswer":"(x-1)/(x+1)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{x+2}{x+3}$  b) $\\frac{2x-4}{x}$  c) $\\frac{x-1}{x+1}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Finn nullpunktene til andregradsuttrykkene med abc-formelen.","Husk: $ax^2+bx+c = a(x-x_1)(x-x_2)$."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-1-5-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-1-5-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Trekk sammen til én brøk.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\dfrac{1}{x - 2} + \\dfrac{1}{x + 2}$","solution":"Fellesnevner $(x-2)(x+2) = x^2 - 4$: $\\frac{(x+2) + (x-2)}{x^2 - 4} = \\frac{2x}{x^2 - 4}$","expressionAnswer":"2x/(x^2-4)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\dfrac{x}{x^2 - 1} - \\dfrac{1}{x + 1}$","solution":"Fellesnevner $(x-1)(x+1)$: $\\frac{x - (x-1)}{(x-1)(x+1)} = \\frac{1}{x^2 - 1}$","expressionAnswer":"1/(x^2-1)"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\dfrac{3}{x} + \\dfrac{2}{x^2}$","solution":"Fellesnevner $x^2$: $\\frac{3x + 2}{x^2}$","expressionAnswer":"(3x+2)/x^2"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{2x}{x^2-4}$  b) $\\frac{1}{x^2-1}$  c) $\\frac{3x+2}{x^2}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Faktoriser nevnerne for å finne fellesnevneren.","Utvid $\\frac{1}{x+1}$ med $(x-1)$ i b."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-1-5-rep-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-1-5-rep-ex-5","number":"R5","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Forenkle de sammensatte uttrykkene.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\dfrac{x^2 - 4}{x^2 - 2x} \\cdot \\dfrac{x}{x + 2}$","solution":"$\\frac{(x-2)(x+2)}{x(x-2)} \\cdot \\frac{x}{x+2} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"b","task":"$\\dfrac{x - \\frac{4}{x}}{1 + \\frac{2}{x}}$","solution":"Gang teller og nevner med $x$: $\\frac{x^2 - 4}{x + 2} = \\frac{(x-2)(x+2)}{x+2} = x - 2$","expressionAnswer":"x-2"},{"label":"c","task":"For hvilke verdier av $x$ er uttrykket i b ikke definert? Oppgi den negative verdien.","solution":"Den opprinnelige brøken krever $x \\neq 0$ (brøkene inni) og $x \\neq -2$ (nevneren $1 + \\frac{2}{x} = 0$ når $x = -2$). Den negative verdien er $-2$.","answer":-2}],"solution":"a) 1  b) $x-2$  c) $x \\neq 0$ og $x \\neq -2$; negativ verdi: $-2$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Faktoriser alt før du multipliserer.","Multipliser teller og nevner med $x$ for å fjerne småbrøkene."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]}],"exercises":[]}